  ('The chip supply chain India is building', 'Map the fabs, packaging and talent.', 'Data-led feature', 'semiconductors', 'r.chip', 'r.chip', 'e.tech', 'commissioned', 'high', 40),
  ('Who profits from the UPI boom?', 'Follow the money behind digital payments.', 'Investigation', 'fintech-and-digital-payments', 'r.fintech', NULL, 'e.fin', 'proposed', 'high', 30),
